 "id": 1851642,
 "titulo": "5/13 Patch Details (Completed)",
 "fecha": 1747119631255,
 "modificada": 1752299891388,
 "url": "https://forum.netmarble.com/futurefight_en/view/2196/1851642",
 "html": "<p><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><img alt=\"\" id=\"1747117401788\" name=\"currImg\" src=\"https://hedwig-cf.netmarble.com/forum-common/mherosgb/futurefight_en/thumbnail/6980fd13a0584122b5381462f29f2b33_1747117401788_d.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;\">&nbsp;</span></span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">&nbsp;</span></span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">Greetings, Agents.</span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">This is CM Fragment of MARVEL Future Fight.</span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">The Thunderbolts* team’s mission is far from over!<br>\nAnother three members with exceptional abilities are ready for battle<br>\nand are now moving on to their destination.</span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"color:#8e44ad;\">Tier-4</span> has been added to <span style=\"color:#8e44ad;\">Taskmaster</span>, a perfect imitator of combat skills,<br>\n<span style=\"color:#8e44ad;\">Tier-3</span> has been added to <span style=\"color:#8e44ad;\">Ghost</span>, who can make his body intangible,<br>\nand <span style=\"color:#8e44ad;\">New Uniforms</span> have been added to everyone, including <span style=\"color:#8e44ad;\">Winter Soldier</span>,<br>\nwho has taken up arms again for the mission.</span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">Agents, make sure to download the patch on 5/13&nbsp;(Tue)<br>\nto check out the new skills and increased powers!</span></span></p>\n\n<p><br>\n<span style=\"color:#8e44ad;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><strong>■ 5/13 Patch Details</strong></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">Patch Schedule: 5/14 (Wed) 3:00 (UTC+0), 5/13 (Tue) 20:00 (PDT)</span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color:#ff0099;\">[5/14&nbsp;(Wed) 2:58&nbsp;(UTC+0), 5/13&nbsp;(Tue) 19:58&nbsp;(PDT) added]</span><br>\nThe patch has been completed as of 5/14 (Wed) 2:54 (UTC+0), 5/13 (Tue) 19:54 (PDT).<br>\nPlease reconnect to the game and download the patch file.</span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"color:#ff0099;\">* The patch completion time may be changed depending on the circumstances.</span><br>\n<span style=\"color:#8e44ad;\">Completion time will be announced once the patch has been completed.</span><br>\n<span style=\"color:#ff0099;\">* The patch will be applied in waves, and the application time may vary by Agent.<br>\n* The game can still be accessed during the patch.<br>\nWhen the patch is complete, please restart and apply the patch for better service.</span></span></span></p>\n\n<p><br>\n<span style=\"color:#e67e22;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><strong>▣ Three New Uniforms</strong></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">To celebrate the Marvel Studios’ <em>Thunderbolts</em>* inspired update,&nbsp;<br>\nthree new uniforms have been added.<br>\nCheck out the abilities of Winter Soldier &lt;<em>Marvel Studios’ Thunderbolts*</em>&gt;,<br>\nTaskmaster &lt;<em>Marvel Studios’ Thunderbolts*</em>&gt;, and Ghost &lt;<em>Marvel Studios’ Thunderbolts*</em>&gt;.<br>\n<span style=\"color:#ff0099;\">* The skill effects of the new hero are based on the maximum skill level stats.<br>\n* The three new Uniforms</span> <span style=\"color:#8e44ad;\">will be on sale for 50% off during the&nbsp;<br>\n&lt;10-Year Anniversary Part. 1 - Discount Events! -&gt;&nbsp;</span><br>\n<span style=\"color:#ff0099;\">and can be checked and purchased in the Marvel Universe and Uniform Room after the Event.</span></span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" height=\"1604\" id=\"1747117621332\" name=\"currImg\" src=\"https://hedwig-cf.netmarble.com/forum-common/mherosgb/futurefight_en/thumbnail/6fe2f26116b44ae2ac9d05576a04d88b_1747117621332_d.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;\" width=\"740\"></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" height=\"1514\" id=\"1747117621339\" name=\"currImg\" src=\"https://hedwig-cf.netmarble.com/forum-common/mherosgb/futurefight_en/thumbnail/b3c29f9aa74a41bd9b8cf9d8b524b748_1747117621339_d.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;\" width=\"740\"></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" height=\"1458\" id=\"1747117621343\" name=\"currImg\" src=\"https://hedwig-cf.netmarble.com/forum-common/mherosgb/futurefight_en/thumbnail/39f100ca34ce4221b56547e6e977828b_1747117621343_d.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;\" width=\"740\"></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><br>\n<span style=\"color:#e67e22;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><strong>▣ Taskmaster Tier-4</strong></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">Tier-4 advancement has been added to Taskmaster,<br>\nwho can replicate the opponent’s fighting style as if looking into a mirror.<br>\n<span style=\"color:#ff0099;\">* The Tier-4 Striker Skill effects are based on Lv.6 stats.</span></span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" id=\"1747117686336\" name=\"currImg\" src=\"https://hedwig-cf.netmarble.com/forum-common/mherosgb/futurefight_en/thumbnail/a34082f69045493ca04e1747f27245c3_1747117686336_d.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;\"></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"color:#e67e22;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">▣ Ghost Tier-3</span></strong></span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">Ghost will actively use her Tier-3 Ultimate skill to make the most of the stealth-designed suit.</span></span></p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" height=\"367\" id=\"1747117702317\" name=\"currImg\" src=\"https://hedwig-cf.netmarble.com/forum-common/mherosgb/futurefight_en/thumbnail/47320658351b4f70831b4ad1eedc2e00_1747117702317_d.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;\" width=\"740\"></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" id=\"1747118735168\" name=\"currImg\" src=\"https://hedwig-cf.netmarble.com/forum-common/mherosgb/futurefight_en/04ae477353b44243b70a7667fd0b0fa0_1747118735168.gif\" style=\"max-width:100%;\"></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"color:#e67e22;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">▣ New Artifacts</span></strong></span></span></p>\n\n<p><br>\n<span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">Exclusive Passive Skill Artifacts for Ghost, and Taskmaster will be added.<br>\n<span style=\"color:#ff0099;\">﻿* The skill effects are based on Lv.4 stats.</span></span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" height=\"604\" id=\"1747118435999\" name=\"currImg\" src=\"https://hedwig-cf.netmarble.com/forum-common/mherosgb/futurefight_en/thumbnail/a130f0d19834436ab0b36d993aa3e2f2_1747118435999_d.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;\" width=\"740\"></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><br>\n<span style=\"color:#e67e22;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><strong>▣ New Uniform Collection</strong></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">Check out the new Uniforms inspired by Marvel Studios’ <em>Thunderbolts</em>* theme.<br>\nComplete the collection by achieving the specified conditions and earn a reward.</span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" height=\"410\" id=\"1747118166061\" name=\"currImg\" src=\"https://hedwig-cf.netmarble.com/forum-common/mherosgb/futurefight_en/thumbnail/34ba9c1e8ced49c6ba3cbf69ec30d5c0_1747118166061_d.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;\" width=\"740\"></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"color:#e67e22;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">▣ Other Improvements and Changes</span></strong></span></span></p>\n\n<p><br>\n<span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">1. Team Battle Arena: Fixed the incorrect display of Arena token rewards in the seasonal&nbsp;<br>\nrewards for the Silver and Gold Leagues.</span></span></p>\n\n<p><br>\n<span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">2. Ranked Battle Event: Fixed an occasional boss freeze in Ranked Battle Events.</span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><br>\n<span style=\"color:#e67e22;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><strong>▣ Game Error Fixes</strong></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p><br>\n<span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">1. Timeline Quest Event: Fixed an issue where Auto Progress is not working&nbsp;</span></span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">when using ranged skill heroes in Timeline Quest, Stage 2-8, \"Mad Archer\"</span></span></p>\n\n<p><br>\n<span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">We look forward to your active participation in the events<br>\nthat will be held to support the growth of the updated heroes.<br>\n&nbsp;<br>\nThank you.</span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><img alt=\"\" id=\"1747117410811\" name=\"currImg\" src=\"https://hedwig-cf.netmarble.com/forum-common/mherosgb/futurefight_en/thumbnail/819da929df25458985cd5d06b6d465e2_1747117410811_d.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;\"></span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n"
}